  "skill": "analysis",
  "instructions": "Avery and Beck form AB Partners as equal partners. The mortgage is a recourse liability shared equally.",
  "exhibits": [
    {
      "title": "Contributions",
      "content": "**Avery:** a building (adjusted basis **$300,000**; FMV **$500,000**) subject to a **$200,000** mortgage the partnership assumes.\n**Beck:** cash of **$300,000**."
